<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit in talks on 1.5 bln ATS steel order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit in talks on 1.5 bln ATS steel order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>VA Industrieanlagenbau, a unit of Austria's VA Technologie said on Tuesday it had signed a letter of intent to deliver a cold rolling mill to South Africa's Saldanha Bay.</p>
<p>The project was worth some 1.5 billion schillings, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiations on this project are in the final stage,&quot; it added. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
